    Inbox AI: operational context + real availability
    
    Adds a grounded, operational Inbox AI context (section budgets, full conversational context, batched tag lookup, directory fields and official answers) with stricter heading budgeting and tests. Introduces Firebase bridge helpers (firebaseHttp) and availability module to load, normalize and append real availability; booking contexts are overwritten with real slots. Integrates availability into suggestion and booking-context flows and updates system instruction to prefer official answers and real slots. Also includes V5 booking projection RPC migration and pgTAP tests. Many unit tests and SDD docs added/updated.

